{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"101713","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/101713","key":"MC-254419","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"21/Jul/22 5:28 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"TheBug%3A\"></a><b>The Bug:</b></h3>\n\n<p>Local game hosting messages aren't prefixed with gray color indicators despite being system messages.</p>\n\n<p>The&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.minecraft.net/en-us/article/minecraft-1-19-1-pre-release-3\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">1.19.1 Pre-release 4</a>&nbsp;changelog states that</p>\n<blockquote><p>System message are now displayed with a gray color indicator</p></blockquote>\n<p>This means that any messages that are displayed by the system, for example, command feedback messages, are prefixed with gray color indicators. Despite messages displayed through opening a world to LAN (when not using the \"/publish\" command) being considered system messages, they are not prefixed with gray color indicators.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"StepstoReproduce%3A\"></a><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></h3>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Join a singleplayer world and display a system message in chat by adding a tag to yourself by executing the following command.</li>\n\t<li><div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/tag @s add test</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Take note of how the command feedback message is correctly prefixed with a gray color indicator as it's a system message.</li>\n\t<li>Open your world to LAN by pressing <em>ESC &gt; Open to LAN &gt; Start LAN World</em> and look at the message displayed in chat.</li>\n\t<li>Take note as to whether or not local game hosting messages are prefixed with gray color indicators.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"ObservedBehavior%3A\"></a><b>Observed Behavior:</b></h3>\n\n<p>Local game hosting messages aren't prefixed with gray color indicators despite being system messages.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"ExpectedBehavior%3A\"></a><b>Expected Behavior:</b></h3>\n\n<p>Local game hosting messages would be prefixed with gray color indicators.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"21/Jul/22 12:31 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/133022","id":"133022","filename":"MC-254419.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/32"},"displayName":"Avoma","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"21/Jul/22 5:28 AM","size":"99 kB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/133022","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/133022"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/133023","id":"133023","filename":"MC-254419 - Analysis.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/48","24x24":"https://avatar-man